   "heroes": [],
   "blocks": [
    {
     "title": "General",
     "body": "- Fixed an issue with weapon audio while using Sierra's Made My Night skin.\n- Fixed a bug with Juno's Pureflow and Fearless skins.",
     "dev": null
    },
    {
     "title": "Heroes",
     "body": "**D.Mon**\n\n- Fixed an issue where D.Mon's Propulsors could launch her much faster when used in the air when compared to when Propulsors were used on the ground.\n\n**Mizuki**\n\n- Fixed a bug where Mizuki could get stuck in the payload on Circuit Royale.\n\n**Sombra**\n\n- Fixed a bug when allied health bars were set to \"Contextual\".\n\n**Wrecking Ball**\n\n- Fixed an issue where Wrecking Ball’s Grappling Claw retract controls could greatly increase his rolling movement speed.",
     "dev": null
    },
    {
     "title": "Maps",
     "body": "**Eichenwalde - Hybrid**\n\n- Made sure the pesky Eichenwalde sightline will never return. Sorry, Torb!\n\n**Watchpoint: Gibraltar - Escort**\n\n- Fixed a spot where some heroes could become stuck on Watchpoint: Gibraltar.",
     "dev": null
    },
    {
     "title": "Stadium",
     "body": "- In a previous update, removed grouping restrictions for Stadium Ranked after they were unintentionally re-enabled.\n- Fixed an issue where Vendetta's Scaled Steel was granting more Palatine Fang Swing Range than intended.\n- El'Saka Suppressor should now work properly on D.Va.",
     "dev": null
    }
   ],
   "maps": []
  }
